.TH WAVE-SELFUPDATE 1 "" "MacWave" "MacWave Manual"

.SH NAME
wave-selfupdate \- Update MacWave itself to the version published in the self-update repository.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wave selfupdate [flags]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Update MacWave itself to the version published in the self-update
repository.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-max\-time <string>
Total time limit for the request (40s, 1min, 1min20s, 2h; bare numbers
are seconds)
.TP
.B \-\-connect\-timeout <string>
Give up if the handshake takes longer (like curl)
.TP
.B \-\-content\-time <string>
Give up if no data arrives for this long
.TP
.B \-\-install\-python\-from\-source
Fetch the bundled Python from its upstream URL instead of MacWave's own
repository

.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
wave selfupdate
wave selfupdate --max-time=2min
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
wave(1)
